<title>USA: IPO PRICING-MemberWorks at $17/shr.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-MemberWorks at $17/shr.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>MemberWorks Inc said on Friday that it made an initial public offering of 2.7 million shares of its common stock at $17 a share.</p>
<p>The company said it is offering 2.4 million shares and selling holders are offering 300,000 shares.</p>
<p>Robertson Stephens &amp; Co LLC, Hambrecht &amp; Quist LLC and PaineWebber Group Inc are managing the offering.  </p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk (212) 859-1700</p>
